971263143796", "message": "Further Implementation of the nav bar\n\nContact Form is also already set up to send messages to\nbluemessproductions@yahoo.com. More optimizations of the css and js.\nalso started with discography image grid within the 400.shtml file to\nencapsulate from the index.html", "created_at": "2014-04-08T13:29:59Z", "repo": "BlueMessProductions", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "deb0b8a15dc142bd5352388b7f45c7762f5f8b24", "message": "First editing of the site itself\n\nadded sass to write the css easier so install scout to edit and play\nwith it. also added a single clicked image to be displayed behind a\ndiscog item placed so the user doesnt have to download an entire image\nfor every item clicked. also working on reducing the amount of css and\njs as you have to download around 1 mb worth of data each site refress\nand thats horrible for mobile.", "created_at": "2014-04-08T02:28:00Z", "repo": "BlueMessProductions", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1174939cc533f97ec09b90efea8baf32a3d5ef5e", "message": "gitignore update to not include countdown site\n\ngitignore update to not include countdown site", "created_at": "2014-03-27T18:13:43Z", "repo": "BlueMessProductions", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "91c6aff0fe0f51498661e4436046176a9c55fa6e", "message": "First Commit of the site\n\nHaven't changed any of the files. There is quite an amount of extraneous\nfiles that have no business being downloaded. Including: the reset from\nyahoo, foundation file can be optimized as 95% not used, normalize not\nused, stellar js and css not even implemented, as well as all the css\nand js files should be concatenated except those served by cms.", "created_at": "2014-03-27T18:08:59Z", "repo": "BlueMessProductions", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e79b8320c4c3e7cedf69fb8333ec427b116